<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Chemapol owners approve rights issue.</title>
<headline>Czech Chemapol owners approve rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Owners of the Czech chemical concern  Chemapol Group a.s. voted at a general meeting to expand the firm's basic capital by 500 million to 1.64 billion crowns through a share issue, a company official said on Friday.</p>
<p>Chemapol's current basic capital is 1.68 billion crowns.</p>
